        "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >About this game</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Memory Matrix Pro</strong> is a minimalist, single-player logic puzzle about <strong>pattern recall</strong>.<br>Each round shows a short pattern on a grid; when it disappears, reconstruct it as fast and as accurately as you can. Rounds are <strong>procedurally generated</strong>, so you always get something new.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Single-player memory/pattern puzzle</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Procedural generation</strong> — fresh layouts every round</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Adjustable difficulty</strong> — from relaxed practice to fast, challenging grids</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Score/Time chase</strong> — play for better accuracy and faster clears</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Tutorial</strong> included for first-time players</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Works offline (airplane mode)</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>No ads and no data collection</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Clean, readable UI for keyboard &amp; mouse</p></li></ul>",
